Type: Project
Package: cardvariance
Title: Card Payments Variance Pipeline and Shiny App
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Weekly targets pipeline that pulls the Central Bank of Ireland
    monthly card payment statistics, computes MoM, QoQ (complete quarters
    only), YoY and YTD variances, validates each release, and publishes it to
    Cloudflare R2 for a Shiny app on Posit Connect.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
